  mechanicIntroductions:
  - mechanic: 0
    title: How to Play
    text: Drag each block out through a gate of its colour!
  - mechanic: 1
    title: Ice Block!
    text: Clear blocks to melt the ice. The number shows how many.
  - mechanic: 2
    title: Ice Door!
    text: Clear blocks to crack open the Ice Door!
  - mechanic: 3
    title: Layered Block!
    text: Each exit peels one layer. The colour beneath goes next.
  - mechanic: 4
    title: One-Way Block!
    text: This block only slides along its arrow.
  - mechanic: 5
    title: Lock & Key!
    text: Clear the block with the key to open the lock of its colour.
  - mechanic: 6
    title: Shutter!
    text: Clear blocks to lift the shutter and see what is beneath.
  - mechanic: 7
    title: Generator!
    text: The machine sends its next block when there is room. Its screen shows what
      comes next.
  - mechanic: 8
    title: Elevator!
    text: Clear every block on the lift to bring up the next wave.
  - mechanic: 9
    title: Time Bonus!
    text: Clear this block to win extra seconds.
